# "Its controller creates a 2/2 white Ox": the player who controls the target as the spell resolves, not its owner. Bot1's
# kicked Thieving Skydiver (X = 1) takes Bot2's Sol Ring; Bot2 then casts Bovine Intervention at that Sol Ring. It is
# destroyed and goes to its owner Bot2's graveyard, and Bot1, who controlled it, gets the Ox. Bot2 gets none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Thieving Skydiver
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Island
Sol Ring
Bovine Intervention
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Thieving Skydiver.Cast(Kicked: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Sol Ring)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Thieving Skydiver; Sol Ring
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Bovine Intervention.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Bovine Intervention; Sol Ring
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Thieving Skydiver; Ox Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Ox Token.Token = true
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Island
